{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":48,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於摩押的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["關於摩押，以色列的上帝——萬軍之耶和華說：",{"text":"「尼波大禍臨頭了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它必被毀滅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列亭必蒙羞淪陷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堡壘必蒙羞被毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押不再受稱讚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人在希實本圖謀害她，說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『來吧！我們剷除這個國家。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪得緬啊，你也將變得死寂無聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀劍必追殺你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"「從何羅念傳來呼喊聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『荒涼了！毀滅了！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押滅亡了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的孩童放聲哀哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人痛哭著走上魯希坡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在何羅念的下坡聽見悲慘的哀號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃命吧！像灌木一樣藏到曠野去吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押啊，你要被攻佔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你倚仗自己的成就和財富。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的神明基抹及供奉它的祭司和官長都要被擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅者必攻擊每一座城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無一倖免；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山谷遭踐踏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平原被毀壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如耶和華所說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「給摩押翅膀讓她飛走吧","poem":1},{"noteId":14},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她的城邑將淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杳無人跡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不殷勤地為耶和華做工，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不揮刀斬殺摩押人的必受咒詛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「摩押自幼常享安逸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從未被擄到別處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像沉澱的酒沒有被從這缸倒到那缸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"味道依舊，香氣未變。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「不過，看啊，時候將到，我要派倒酒的人去把她倒出來，倒空酒缸，把缸打碎。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["摩押人必因他們的神明基抹而羞愧，就像以色列人因信靠伯特利的神像而羞愧一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「摩押人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們怎能自稱為驍勇善戰的英雄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押要滅亡了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑要被摧毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她最勇敢的青年將被殺戮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是名叫萬軍之耶和華的君王說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押快要被毀滅了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的災難就要來臨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的近鄰和知道她名望的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都要為她哀悼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『那強大、輝煌的權勢竟然崩潰了！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「底本的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要從榮耀的位子上下來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在乾旱的地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為毀滅摩押的要來攻擊你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀你們的堡壘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞羅珥的居民啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要站在路旁觀望，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"詢問逃難的男女究竟發生了什麼事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們會得知摩押淪陷了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她羞愧難當。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們哀傷痛哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要在亞嫩河邊宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『摩押被毀滅了！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["「審判降臨在平原上的何倫、雅雜、米法押、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["底本、尼波、伯·低比拉太音、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["基列亭、伯·迦末、伯·米恩、"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["加略、波斯拉等摩押遠近各地的城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["摩押的權勢被粉碎了，她的力量被摧毀了。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["「你們要灌醉她，因為她藐視耶和華。她必在自己的嘔吐物中打滾，被人恥笑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["摩押啊，你不是曾經嘲笑以色列嗎？以色列難道是強盜嗎？你每次談到她總是不屑地搖頭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"「摩押人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要離開城邑，住到巖洞裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鴿子在巖縫裡築巢一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們聽說摩押傲氣沖天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狂妄自大、心中高傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道摩押的狂傲不過是外強中乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的誇耀不過是虛張聲勢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要為她哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為摩押人痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為吉珥·哈列設人悲傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西比瑪的葡萄樹啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為你比為雅謝人哭得更悲痛！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的枝條雖然延伸到大海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一直到雅謝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但毀滅者已在蹂躪你夏日的果子和葡萄！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的沃土上再沒有歡喜快樂的聲音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使榨酒池不出酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再沒有踩踏葡萄的歡呼聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歡呼被吶喊取代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":["「哀哭聲從希實本傳到以利亞利和雅雜，又從瑣珥傳到何羅念和伊基拉·施利施亞，因為連寧林的水也乾涸了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":["耶和華說：「我要滅絕摩押那些在邱壇獻祭和向他們神明燒香的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":["我的心為摩押悲鳴，好像淒涼的簫聲；我的心為吉珥·哈列設人悲鳴，好像淒涼的簫聲。他們的一切財富都消失了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":["他們都悲哀地剃去髮鬚，割傷雙手，腰束麻布。"]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":["在摩押境內的屋頂和街頭巷尾，哀聲處處可聞，因為我已把摩押打得粉碎，好像打碎沒人要的器皿。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":["摩押破碎不堪！她嚎啕痛哭，羞愧難當，令四圍的人嗤笑、驚懼。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「看啊，敵人必像展翅疾飛的大鷹一樣來攻擊摩押。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要攻取城池，佔領堡壘。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，摩押的勇士像臨盆的婦人一樣心驚膽戰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押必被摧毀，最後亡國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她藐視耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要充滿恐懼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陷入深坑和網羅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃過驚恐的必落入深坑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爬出深坑的必陷入網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我懲罰摩押的時候到了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"text":"「在希實本的蔭影下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃難的人無助地站著，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為希實本烈焰熊熊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西宏的城火光沖天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀了摩押和其中的叛逆之人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人啊，你們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拜基抹神明的人滅亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的兒女都被擄去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但將來，我要使摩押被擄的人返鄉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對摩押的審判到此為止。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"「給摩押翅膀讓她飛走吧，」或譯作「給摩押豎起墓碑吧，因為她將被毀滅」或「在摩押撒鹽吧，因為她將被毀滅」。","reference":{"chapter":48,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":47}